      "query": "queries.scm",
      "capabilities": [
        "definitions",
        "references"
      ],
      "reason": "Declaration merging is not resolved. An interface declared twice, a namespace reopened, and a class, function or enum augmented by a namespace of the same name are stated as the separate declarations they are written as."
    },
