      "reason": "A decorator is stated as a mention of the decorator's own name. What it does to the declaration it is attached to -- registering a route, injecting a dependency, defining a component -- is one library's semantics and belongs in an overlay under 'frameworks/', and so does anything a test runner's 'describe'/'it' shape would say."
    },
